    {
      "text": "Place chicken, water, celery, carrot, green onion, chicken bouillon, parsley, bay leaf, seasoned salt, salt, dried basil, and pepper into the bottom of a slow cooker. Cover and cook on Low until chicken breasts are no longer pink in the centers, 5 to 6 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HOZILSHPgmtq0Ut2eDuh_62gkZc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275973-slow-cooker-chicken-noodle-soup-ddmfs-step-3-0148-3x4-03611485d0e2442aa5f29618d1edd2c0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275973/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove and discard bay leaf. Remove chicken, shred using 2 forks.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/AHQREXlhN9rRwfplYTZzISTQZ6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275973-slow-cooker-chicken-noodle-soup-ddmfs-step-4-0154-3x4-0ccbbc3bae054b54ac987e482b12674c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275973/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return shredded chicken to the pot. Stir in egg noodles.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sWfVSOfULNKkzGE783GPJPzP9b4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/275973-slow-cooker-chicken-noodle-soup-ddmfs-step-5-0158-3x4-9a38fd00d5c24c4995106ea332973223.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/275973/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover and continue to cook on Low until noodles are tender, 20 to 30 minutes more.",
